# Cloudflare Realtime TURN API token (optional; without it only STUN is used).
# TURN_API_TOKEN=
# Signs Web Push requests (P-256 JWK). Dev-only key; generate your own with
# `bun run vapid-key`. Production uses `wrangler secret put VAPID_KEY`.
VAPID_KEY='{"kty":"EC","crv":"P-256","x":"nRUmzEqQVpeWiKAUvpnQ-Va5nx-TFIBZEZw-l4_WAJo","y":"4J0_kFqeJTd1pWY8cKMFHfIzEaLBO687lyNaEMWOyHI","d":"TIsjqxdOQl_hidcHh10nwFl_HqvSycb7ZD9ilfeoBwo"}'
# GitHub OAuth app for connecting an account and cloning repos (optional).
# Its callback URL is <PUBLIC_URL>/api/github/callback. Production uses
